consume_parameter_an_element_of_a_container_this_frame_owns.vyrn:1:0: `nn[0]` may not be passed to a `consume` parameter via `take(..)` — it is read out of a place that owns it
  fix: `nn[0].copy()` — the callee owns its copy
  fix: `nn.swapRemove(..)` returns the element and leaves the container one shorter
